vrtest-fortran
==============

This project is a modern Fortran translation of vrtest version 1.2, an R
package by Jae H. Kim for variance-ratio and other martingale-difference
tests.

Original package metadata:

  Package: vrtest
  Version: 1.2
  Date: 2023-08-31
  Author and maintainer: Jae H. Kim
  Declared license: GPL-2

The Fortran project is distributed under GPL version 2 only, represented by
the SPDX identifier GPL-2.0-only. The complete GPL version 2 text is in
LICENSE. The unmodified supplied R package is retained under
original/vrtest-1.2 for attribution, auditability, and formula comparison.
It is not compiled by FPM.

The translation preserves numerical algorithms and public test families,
while replacing R lists with derived types and replacing R random-number,
linear-algebra, distribution, rank, and quantile functions with self-contained
Fortran implementations.

No warranty is provided.
